{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519860/extras/fead151fefea4c8680b99dd63bbec0b0.avif?t=1772650714\" width=1080 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where humans are born with an <strong>Affinity</strong>, the mark that gives them the power to control one of the four natural elements, Arane Kross grows up deprived of this gift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite the taboos surrounding the use of technology, the young woman takes refuge in the design of machines to try to overcome her handicap until the day she inherits an orb capable of <strong>controlling nature</strong>: the Ecosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arane is then recruited by an order to protect the environment, the <strong>Green League</strong>, to fulfill her civic duty. A year full of dangers where any difference is perceived as a weakness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519860/extras/89bbe3566fde2b0b09ee068f848e8e27.avif?t=1772650714\" width=1080 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this Visual Novel, join the Green League and dive into a society filled with inequalities between those born with an Affinity and those without. As <strong>civil war looms</strong> between these two factions, a conspiracy brews to overthrow the established order. What will your place be on this chessboard?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519860/extras/6e030bde357e59cbf0388664352364d4.avif?t=1772650714\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519860/extras_big/6e030bde357e59cbf0388664352364d4.webp?t=1772650714 width=1560 height=688 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through your interactions with the many NPCs and the choices offered throughout the game, you'll impact this universe: between benevolence and resentment, the fate of the world is in your hands. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519860/extras/67990b251efb1c2a90f961519c4f4b96.avif?t=1772650714\" width=1080 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519860/extras/4b9204edf18f06c102298b7ae960ff7d.avif?t=1772650714\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc9a You can enter into romantic relationships with any of the four companions who cross your path. Unless you prefer an adventure without romance? Love comes in many forms!\u00a0<strong>The choice is yours</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519860/extras/367516608a5018a33a429e8b7858ebe3.avif?t=1772650714\" width=1080 height=219 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd00 Multiple Ends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to influencing your romantic relationships, your choices will impact the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519860/extras/c8925944a08ca0abb7bf2d5a59da751e.poster.avif?t=1772650714\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519860/extras/c8925944a08ca0abb7bf2d5a59da751e.webm?t=1772650714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519860/extras/c8925944a08ca0abb7bf2d5a59da751e.mp4?t=1772650714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f Dynamic Choices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on <strong>Quick Time Events</strong>, dynamic buttons will appear during action sequences to determine the outcome!<br><br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519860/extras/dd0af7285dc5d90f9c67d58b9c7f3a3c.poster.avif?t=1772650714\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519860/extras/dd0af7285dc5d90f9c67d58b9c7f3a3c.webm?t=1772650714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519860/extras/dd0af7285dc5d90f9c67d58b9c7f3a3c.mp4?t=1772650714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc51 Exploration Phases</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and interact with various environments, thanks to a <strong>point-and-click system</strong> to unlock narrative content.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519860/extras/e80474be4e2507cf63001a19025335f0.poster.avif?t=1772650714\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519860/extras/e80474be4e2507cf63001a19025335f0.webm?t=1772650714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519860/extras/e80474be4e2507cf63001a19025335f0.mp4?t=1772650714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Interactive Computer Graphics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clickable elements or short <strong>comic strip</strong> sequences will highlight key scenes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519860/extras/523297cca99c1f9e4327c4b951b427e3.poster.avif?t=1772650714\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519860/extras/523297cca99c1f9e4327c4b951b427e3.webm?t=1772650714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519860/extras/523297cca99c1f9e4327c4b951b427e3.mp4?t=1772650714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2519860?t=1772650714","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519860/7d4d2b549a13af5c9ec8b1072cb7226c7b230f43/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772650714","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519860/a9a6a2aece58f2c492f902959477e68e961d0489/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772650714","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519860/a9a6a2aece58f2c492f902959477e68e961d0489/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772650714","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2800830,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset